 "rows": [
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.20",
   "en": "Why the hell should I have to tag along with you?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.21",
   "en": "Please. I have to stop him."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.22",
   "en": "...Tch! Fine, let's get this over with!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.26",
   "en": "I'm here, Shadow Moon! Where are you!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.27",
   "en": "..."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.28",
   "en": "Shadow Moon... So you really are alive."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.31",
   "en": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.32",
   "en": "Shadow Moon! Are you set on fighting me no matter what!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.33",
   "en": "Would you bring that nightmare back to life all over again!? Shadow Moon!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.34",
   "en": "I...! I don't want to fight you!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.35",
   "en": "I don't want to fight!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.37",
   "en": "Kuah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.38",
   "en": "Answer me, Shadow Moon! Say something!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.39",
   "en": "My name is Shadow Moon, Black Sun."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.40",
   "en": "The messenger of death, risen from Hell to bury you."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.42",
   "en": "Uwaah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.43",
   "en": "Stop it, Shadow Moon! Stop!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.45",
   "en": "Shadow Moon, the Prince of Shadows, lost all memory of his days as Black RX's best friend."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.46",
   "en": "That was the heavy price he paid to survive, and only barely at that."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.47",
   "en": "And so he wandered, driven by the one thing he had left:"
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.48",
   "en": "the instinct to defeat Kamen Rider Black RX..."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.49",
   "en": "And now, Black RX understood as well."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.50",
   "en": "The Shadow Moon he once knew was dead."
  },
  {
   "key": "Table/Event/Quest/QuestEventMess017.mbb#0.51",
   "en": "What stood before him now was another mighty enemy, every bit the equal of Crisis."
  },
